{
  "label": "day120",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day120:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene street_noon",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/street_noon.png",
      "alt": "street_noon"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I find myself walking home after yet another uneventful day at[school].",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I say ‘uneventful’ in the loosest possible sense because Yumi actually showed up today, and that’s always something to celebrate.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, it’s something to celebrate when I’m not forcing her to stop insulting the other girls in order to make up for her...apparent inferiority complex?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now that I think of it, I don’t really understand why Yumi is so mean to everyone to begin with.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It has to be an inferiority complex, right? That’s normally how the bully trope goes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And God forbid these girls start subverting their character tropes. That would really throw me off.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! Tall guy! Over here!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tall guy?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain1.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yo!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you suddenly calling me “tall guy?”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain2.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh? Cause you’re tall and you’re a guy. I thought it was pretty obvious.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I mean, yes. But you’ve never called me that before. It makes it sound like we don’t know each other.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who cares? The only other person around is Sana and I’m pretty sure she knows that we’re cool.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Once Rin points that out, I realize that the streets are eerily empty today. I wonder if it’s because of the heat?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No, that can’t be it. Both of them are wearing long sleeves.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Where the hell is everyone?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, either way, go back to calling me Sensei. I don’t want to be “tall guy” anymore.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if cafe25 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s bad enough that Kaori is already calling me Hamburger Man. Another nickname would be too much to keep track of.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain3.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...isn’t...there already a real Hamburger Man?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A...real Hamburger Man?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you talking about the one from that fast food chain? The clown dude?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain4.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. Isn’t he called...the Hamburger Man?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...no.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He’s got like, an actual name. I just don’t think we’re allowed to say it on-screen because of copyright stuff.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain5.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...well, um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think...I’m going to keep calling him the Hamburger Man anyway...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Two hamburger people is too many...I think Sensei should change.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I am tired of being a hamburger-person. Take me out of this isekai right now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure? You can be Tall Guy and Sana can be Short Girl. You’ll be like a superhero duo.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain4.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...what would that make you then, Rin?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh, I don’t know?...Average-height Lass?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...not a very good superhero name...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, nicknames aside, I’m glad to see you two are getting along.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain6.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dude, same! Sana and I have like, a zillion things in common. Who would have ever thought?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. How close have the two of you gotten over the last few weeks?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin let me touch her skulls.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I did! No one’s ever asked to do that before.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even Futaba is like “Umm...can you turn those away when I’m trying to sleep?”",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I basically have to give her a friggin’ pep talk every night. But Sana here just walked up to them and started doing the Hamlet thing.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She...spontaneously recited a monologue to a skull?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain7.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...that part...didn’t happen.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I kind of just...held one for a little while.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right. Totally misremembered that scene in my head. Whoops.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But yeah, Sana’s basically like a little sister to me already. Which is cool cause I’m kind of like Futaba’s little sister.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So the three of us are gonna form a sisterhood and start sharing pants or however that one story goes.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I glance at Sana, who seems content but still struggling to keep up with Rin’s, uhh, pace.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Having known the two of them for some time now, I can see how they’d get along so well, but I can also see how it might be difficult at times.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin is adept when it comes to communicating with people, but lacks a filter.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And, of course, Sana is the complete opposite.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But either way, I’m glad to see the two of them spending time together like this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain8.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...I don’t know much about...sharing pants...but I am really happy to have another friend now.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane is...still a little too much for me sometimes...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain9.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oooooh, I totally forgot you two were even roommates! I don’t really talk to Ayane that much.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s she like? That sword she brought in the other day was really cool. Do you think she’d let me hold it?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...I don’t really know if she’d let you hold it...but she’s really nice.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She was willing to get to know me when nobody else was so...I’m really thankful for her.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain10.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dude, everyone is willing to get to know you. You’ve just gotta put in some of the work.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": People are like, totally weird and annoying and stuff, but no one is gonna see you and be like “Nahh I’m good.”",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve just gotta do the thing and then stuff will happen.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain11.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...can you...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You need me to translate for you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes please...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain12.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...did I say something weird? What part about that was confusing?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think Rin is trying to say that everyone would be open to being your friend because of how cute you are.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain13.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah! That! That’s much easier to understand than how I put it!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wh-what?!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain14.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, you probably don’t realize this since you’re like, super shy and awkward and stuff, but you’re low-key one of the cutest girls in the entire world.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kind of like a cross between a lost kitten and an excited puppy. Oh- and like, four baby seals thrown into the mix.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain15.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s too many things! I’m just a girl!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah but girls are the best! There’s a reason I’m so into-",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain16.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Uh-oh.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain17.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Into what?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...uhh...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain18.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Makeup! I’m really into makeup! Because...it looks better on girls than it looks on boys!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...umm...I see...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain19.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pah...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin suddenly deflates as she narrowly avoids revealing to her new friend that she’s [[probably] sexually attracted to her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can only imagine how finding out something like that would impact Sana, who I’m pretty sure is at least six-hundred years away from becoming curious about romance.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei...I, um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want to...thank you again for...all of your help.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Without you...I wouldn’t be able to-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t thank me yet, Sana. Your character arc has barely even started.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlsagain20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlsagain20.webp",
      "alt": "girlsagain20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My...what?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I told you in class the other day. We can’t call it quits on your progression until you’re friends with everyone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t make it sound like doubling your previous count of just one friend is enough to satisfy me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
